│ evaporates without residues and it has a good patient compliance. In vitro studies have also shown that this         │
│ formulation enhances the delivery of the active compound through the skin. Aim\u2002 To evaluate the efficacy,       │
│ safety and tolerability of CF in the treatment of moderate to severe AA. Subjects and methods\u2002 Thirty‐four      │
│ patients with moderate to severe AA (eight men, mean age 40\xa0±\xa013\xa0years) were enrolled in a randomized,      │
│ double‐blind, right‐to‐left, placebo‐controlled, 24‐week trial. Alopecia grading score (AGS) was calculated at       │
│ baseline and after 12 and 24\xa0weeks of treatment using a 0–5 score (0\xa0=\xa0no alopecia; 5\xa0=\xa0alopecia      │
